  "problem": "Independent review of 941c9cd reproduced four passing controls and six failed contract cases: search/browse lacked projectFreshness fields, numeric browse omitted the evaluation clock, unknown verification was labelled a successful metadata check, explicit null attempt timestamps were replaced by observation dates, inferred/unavailable grain rendered as Hospital, and ordinary Date headers were accepted as the evaluation clock. The WP11 historical-input gate remains a separate integration blocker spanning 11 implementation/test/type files.",
  "resulting_behavior": "Public search, object browse, numeric browse fallback, and dataset lookup emit one freshness projection when a request clock is present. Frozen retrieve without now keeps catalog-contract freshnessState so lexical/direct-base byte-parity stays deterministic. Ordinary caller Date headers are ignored; explicit injected now remains for internal tests. Unknown and not_live_verified observations are not last-successful-check evidence; explicit null attempt timestamps stay unknown through adapter, card, and detail. Only source_asserted or verified_first_party observation-grain claims render as Typical unit/Grain. Controller semantics replay has ten passing cases. npm run test:worker remains failed-closed on WP11 historical pins. PR-005 is functionally corrected and integration-blocked until the independently reviewed attestation follow-up is combined.",
